  "title": "Variant preserves a named Cluster",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "Variant preserves a named Cluster",
    "name_source": "document",
    "description": "The typed Variant retains the Cluster field identities and values. The same Cluster is used only as a schema witness for unboxing; it is not substituted for the payload.\n\nThe typed Variant retains the Cluster field identities and values. The same Cluster is used only as a schema witness for unboxing; it is not substituted for the payload.\n\nMode: execution. Profile: studio-draft. Capability: studio.native.composed@1.\nExpected:\nnumber (i64) = 9007199254740993\ntext (string) = \"kept\"\n",
